# AOS Physiological Gate

Before calling high-risk tools, verify physiological clearance:
- `propose_dna_mutation` — blocked if cortisol > 90% or threat > Inflammation
- `spawn_child_instance` — blocked if energy < 50% or fever active
- `execute_motor_command` — blocked during Sepsis

Use MCP tools: `get_physiological_dampening`, `get_energy_status`, `get_global_vibe`.

When stressed, prioritize: heal → filtrate → consolidate memory. Do not mutate DNA under fever.
